>
> > @@ -0,0 +1,34 @@
> > +#ifndef TEST_UNIT_MATH_PRIM_MAT_VECTORIZE_FOO_FUN_HPP
>
> Ok. I'm ok without a "real" example, but the other things should be addressed.
>
