It's not that a single banana is too heavy to carry, it's
that a fruit basket with half a dozen varieties of banana
in bunches, a bushel of corn, a peck of tomatoes, two stone
of potatoes, five of blueberries, and a case of grapes in
wine form is too much to carry for one or two people.

So we either buy a donkey or get choosy about which fruit
we tote around.

- Bob

