Hi, this is a great start!  I’d like to do more regarding the derivation, we can talk more at Stan mtg.  Also, channeling Andrew, here are some quick non-substantive comments:
- Graphs should not go below 0 on y-axis, and fig 1 should not go below 0 on x-axis either.
- On p.8, I would not call it the “frequentist estimator” as any estimator can be evaluated using frequency properties.  Just call it the least-squares estimate.  (Plz also call it least squares, not OLS.)
- Also for good practice on that page please use display() to summarize the fitted model.
A

