Bob and I sat down and we wrote out the current output and format here: https://github.com/stan-dev/stan/wiki/Consolidated-Output-for-Sample,-Optimize,-ADVI,-and-Diagnose

This is pretty much the document I was envisioning writing when Bob brought it up at the meeting.

>
> Sorry, I thought I could do something here without you being more specific about what you were looking for but from the meeting it sounds like you have very specific goals that I don't understand.

My specific goal was to replace terrible code with better code. This will help alleviate a few things, including being able to change the format in intermediate steps, if necessary. If everyone is on board with just replacing the existing format, then we can do that instead and you can ignore my request for just writing better code.

